---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy | Antons Blocked Drains North Beaches" description="Read how Antons handles phone enquiries, property details, website visits and optional analytics, plus how to contact our team with privacy questions." crumbs={[{name:'Privacy',href:'/privacy'}]}>
  <div class="wrap intro-page"><h1>Privacy.</h1></div><article class="wrap legal"><p>This website provides information about our drainage services. The operating business is identified in the footer.</p><h2>Phone enquiries</h2><p>When you contact the team, the information you provide—such as your name, contact details, property address, symptoms and access instructions—is used to discuss your enquiry and arrange the requested service. Please provide only information relevant to the job.</p><h2>Website visits</h2><p>This site has no online enquiry form, account registration or online payment facility. The hosting provider may process technical request information, such as IP address and browser details, to deliver and protect the website. Videos and photographs are served directly from the site.</p><h2>Optional analytics</h2><p>When Google Analytics is enabled by the site operator, it may collect website usage information and phone-link click events using cookies or similar technologies. Clicking the call link does not establish that a call was completed. Browser settings and available privacy controls can limit cookies. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s privacy information</a>.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information provided with an enquiry, call <a href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>. This page describes this website’s features and enquiry handling; ask the team about specific service records or access requests.</p></article>
</Layout>
